      "behavior_id": "B001",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B001",
      "text": "check_type returns the original value when lists and dictionaries satisfy their parameterized element, key, and value types, including dict[str, list[int]]."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B002",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B002",
      "text": "check_type accepts None for Optional[int] and values matching any Union member, but raises TypeCheckError when a non-member value such as a string is checked against Optional[int]."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B003",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B003",
      "text": "CollectionCheckStrategy.FIRST_ITEM may accept a heterogeneous collection after checking only its first item, whereas ALL_ITEMS checks every item and raises TypeCheckError on a later mismatch."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B004",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B004",
      "text": "dict[str, list[int]] nesting is checked."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B005",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B005",
      "text": "The package exposes check_type/TypeCheckError/CollectionCheckStrategy with the kinds listed in this contract."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B006",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B006",
      "text": "the submitted package does not import forbidden upstream packages: typeguard."
